 "text": "-->\nBack To The Mill | Active Feed Company\ntop of page\nSkip to Main Content\nBack To The Mill\nOur Story\nOur Product\nMarkets\nActive Feed Family\nContact\nMore\nUse tab to navigate through the menu items.\n7564 Pigeon Rd\nPigeon, Mi. 48755\n(989) - 453 - 2472\nBeef, Dairy, Swine Poultry Feed\nEst. 1961\nMission Statement\n\"Our mission is to meet the individual needs of the Mid-Michigan agricultural community by manufacturing livestock feed products that exceed the highest industry standards for safe feeds, while boosting both production and animal health. We strive for excellence in both service and product quality, providing custom feed mixes to supplement the individual feeding practices of our customers.\"\nJoseph J Maust (1943 - 2015)\nPresident\nbottom of page",
